# World ID production proofs must never be committed. A production `nullifier`
# is a persistent pseudonymous identifier tied to a real Orb-verified identity:
# stable per (identity, rp_id, action), so publishing one lets anyone link that
# person's future verifications. Staging fixtures are fine.
*.PRIVATE.json
*production*.json
test/fixtures/**/production/
